    "detailed_description": "Hexillume is a relaxing, minimalist puzzle game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow to play<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMove the hexagons so their triangles are pointing towards another triangle. When all the triangles are lit up, the hexagon will light up. Light up all the hexagons to complete the level. Some hexagons cannot be moved, but can be rotated, flipped and more. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nLevels start easy and gradually get more difficult.<br />\r\nUse hints to help solve tricky levels!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* 85 levels to beat<br />\r\n* A relaxing soundtrack<br />\r\n* Easy to play<br />\r\n* No time limit<br />\r\n* Earn a crown in every level by beating it in the perfect amount of moves",
    "about_the_game": "Hexillume is a relaxing, minimalist puzzle game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow to play<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMove the hexagons so their triangles are pointing towards another triangle. When all the triangles are lit up, the hexagon will light up. Light up all the hexagons to complete the level. Some hexagons cannot be moved, but can be rotated, flipped and more. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nLevels start easy and gradually get more difficult.<br />\r\nUse hints to help solve tricky levels!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* 85 levels to beat<br />\r\n* A relaxing soundtrack<br />\r\n* Easy to play<br />\r\n* No time limit<br />\r\n* Earn a crown in every level by beating it in the perfect amount of moves",
    "short_description": "Connect the hexagons to light them up. Experience beautiful colour themes in every level. Discover new hexagon types as you progress.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
